  "body": "The owners have made their decision, and their instructions are clear. With their next chapter firmly in sight, they are motivated to see this property sold. Offering striking architecture, generous proportions and elevated coastal views, this is a home with plenty to offer buyers seeking space and versatility.\r\n\r\nSet across multiple levels, the home enjoys an elevated outlook across the estuary to the sea. Expansive open plan living and dining occupy the main level, where large windows draw in natural light and sliding doors open to a substantial covered entertaining deck. The kitchen is equally impressive, featuring extensive bench space, a walk in pantry and excellent storage, all positioned to enjoy the outlook.\r\n\r\nWith multiple living areas, generously sized bedrooms and a private master retreat, the layout provides excellent separation across the different levels. There is plenty of flexibility for extended families, teenagers, guests or those working from home, with separate spaces that offer both privacy and practicality.\r\n\r\n* Substantial multi-level home with striking architectural design\r\n* Elevated estuary and sea views from the main living areas\r\n* Expansive open plan kitchen, dining and living\r\n* Large covered deck overlooking the coastal landscape\r\n* Well appointed kitchen with walk in pantry and extensive storage\r\n* Multiple living areas providing excellent separation\r\n* Private master suite with its own living area and luxurious ensuite\r\n* Fully tiled bathrooms including family bathroom with bath\r\n* Ducted heating and cooling upstairs, plus heat pumps on lower levels\r\n* Double internal access garage and generous off street parking\r\n* Landscaped backyard with established palms and lawn\r\n* Excellent flexibility for extended or multi-generational living\r\n\r\nEnjoy easy access to the Millwater Estuary, nearby schools and daycares, Orewa Beach, local cafes and motorway connections, all while enjoying the space and outlook this elevated position provides. The owners are committed to their next move and ready to see a result. Buyers are encouraged to inspect and make their interest known.\r\n\r\nFor more information, please download the files within the link: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/D92N\r\n\r\n*All agents conjunctionals are welcomed",
